  "solution": {
    "text": "<p>We have, <math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">g</mi><mfenced separators=\"|\"><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">x</mi></mfenced><mo>=</mo><mfenced open=\"{\" close=\"\"><mtable columnspacing=\"1.4ex\" columnalign=\"left\"><mtr><mtd><msup><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">x</mi><mn>3</mn></msup><mi>sin</mi><mo>&#8289;</mo><mfrac><mn>1</mn><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">x</mi></mfrac></mtd><mtd><mo>:</mo><mi>x</mi><mo>&#8800;</mo><mn>0</mn></mtd></mtr><mtr><mtd><mn>0</mn></mtd><mtd><mo>:</mo><mi>x</mi><mo>=</mo><mn>0</mn></mtd></mtr></mtable></mfenced></math><br />For <math><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">x</mi><mo>&#8800;</mo><mn>0</mn><mo>,</mo></math><br /><math> <mrow> <msup> <mtext>g</mtext> <mo>&#8242;</mo> </msup> <mfenced> <mtext>x</mtext> </mfenced><mo>=</mo><msup> <mtext>x</mtext> <mn>3</mn> </msup> <mi>cos</mi><mfrac> <mn>1</mn> <mtext>x</mtext> </mfrac> <mfenced> <mrow> <mo>&#8722;</mo><mfrac> <mn>1</mn> <mrow> <msup> <mtext>x</mtext> <mn>2</mn> </msup> </mrow> </mfrac> </mrow> </mfenced><mo>+</mo><mn>3</mn><msup> <mtext>x</mtext> <mn>2</mn> </msup> <mi>sin</mi><mfrac> <mn>1</mn> <mtext>x</mtext> </mfrac> </mrow> </math><br /><math><mo>=</mo><mo>-</mo><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">x</mi><mrow><mrow><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">cos</mi></mrow><mo>&#8289;</mo><mrow><mfrac><mrow><mn>1</mn></mrow><mrow><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">x</mi></mrow></mfrac><mo>+</mo><mo>+</mo><mn>3</mn><msup><mrow><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">x</mi></mrow><mrow><mn>2</mn></mrow></msup><mrow><mrow><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">sin</mi></mrow><mo>&#8289;</mo><mrow><mfrac><mrow><mn>1</mn></mrow><mrow><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">x</mi></mrow></mfrac></mrow></mrow></mrow></mrow></math><br />For <math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">x</mi><mo>=</mo><mn>0</mn><mo>,</mo></math><br /><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><msup><mtext>g</mtext><mo>'</mo></msup><mfenced><mn>0</mn></mfenced><mo>=</mo><munder><mi>lim</mi><mrow><mtext>x</mtext><mo>&#8594;</mo><mn>0</mn></mrow></munder><mfrac><mrow><mtext>g</mtext><mfenced><mtext>x</mtext></mfenced><mo>&#8722;</mo><mtext>g</mtext><mfenced><mn>0</mn></mfenced></mrow><mrow><mtext>x</mtext><mo>&#8722;</mo><mn>0</mn></mrow></mfrac><mo>=</mo><munder><mi>lim</mi><mrow><mtext>x</mtext><mo>&#8594;</mo><mn>0</mn></mrow></munder><mfrac><mrow><msup><mtext>x</mtext><mn>3</mn></msup><mi>sin</mi><mfrac><mn>1</mn><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">x</mi></mfrac><mo>&#8722;</mo><mn>0</mn></mrow><mtext>x</mtext></mfrac></math><br /><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mo>=</mo><munder><mi>lim</mi><mrow><mtext>x</mtext><mo>&#8594;</mo><mn>0</mn></mrow></munder><msup><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">x</mi><mn>2</mn></msup><mi>sin</mi><mo>&#8289;</mo><mfrac><mn>1</mn><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">x</mi></mfrac><mo>=</mo><mn>0</mn><mo>.</mo></math><br /><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mo>&#8756;</mo><msup><mtext>g</mtext><mo>'</mo></msup><mfenced><mtext>x</mtext></mfenced><mo>=</mo><mfenced open=\"{\" close=\"\"><mtable equalrows=\"true\" equalcolumns=\"true\"><mtr><mtd><mn>3</mn><msup><mtext>x</mtext><mn>2</mn></msup><mi>sin</mi><mfrac><mn>1</mn><mtext>x</mtext></mfrac><mo>&#8722;</mo><mi>x</mi><mi>cos</mi><mfrac><mn>1</mn><mtext>x</mtext></mfrac><mo>,</mo><mo>&#160;</mo><mi>x</mi><mo>&#8800;</mo><mn>0</mn></mtd></mtr><mtr><mtd><mn>0</mn><mo>,</mo><mo>&#160;</mo><mi>x</mi><mo>=</mo><mn>0</mn></mtd></mtr></mtable></mfenced></math><br /><math> <msup> <mtext>g</mtext> <mo>&#8242;</mo> </msup> </math> is continuous at <math><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">x</mi><mo>=</mo><mn>0</mn></math><br />Also, <math><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">g</mi></math> is differentiable at <math><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">x</mi><mo>=</mo><mn>0</mn></math> .</p>"
